# site host: a third-party host a taught site's own frontend calls, read and
# approved by a person. chewbacca api sync refuses any other off-domain host.

# 2026-10-09: ycombinator.com/companies searches an Algolia index with the
# public search-only key the page itself serves. No cookie rides along.
yc 45bwzj1sgc-dsn.algolia.net
yc 45bwzj1sgc-3.algolianet.com

# 2026-10-09: linkedin-jobs reads LinkedIn's logged-out guest job search and
# holds no cookie or session ref. It sits on linkedin.com beside his LinkedIn
# login, so its browser fallback would run signed in; reviewed and accepted
# because every op is a read of a public page.
linkedin-jobs signed-in-ok

# 2026-10-10: brightspace reads his own courses, grades and dropboxes with his
# USC session, all GET JSON on brightspace.usc.edu. Spec reviewed: 7 ops, all
# read-only, no off-domain host, no example values.
brightspace signed-in-ok

# 2026-10-10: handshake reads job, event and career-fair search plus a job
# by id with his USC Handshake session. Every op hits a .json endpoint on
# usc.joinhandshake.com: the HTML pages write recent searches and viewed
# marks on load. Reviewed: 4 ops, read-only, no off-domain host.
handshake signed-in-ok

# 2026-10-10: usc-reg reads his WebReg appointment, holds, schedule and
# course bin, Fall 2026 and Spring 2027, through his USC sign-in (Entra).
# Reviewed: 8 GET ops on webreg.usc.edu, read-only; the pages fire only GETs
# and telemetry. Never touch the bin page forms (Schedule, Remove, grade option).
usc-reg signed-in-ok

# 2026-10-10: usc-fees reads his Registration and Fee Summary (registered
# terms, one term's charges, credits, pending aid and net charges) through his
# USC sign-in (Entra). Reviewed: 2 GET JSON ops on atweb.usc.edu, read-only;
# the page fires only GETs. The ops pick fields so the profile block (USC ID,
# addresses, phones) never comes back. The Download Report button is not used.
usc-fees signed-in-ok

# 2026-10-13: usc-parking reads the student's own parking account and active
# permits on usc.aimsparking.com (AIMS), signed in through USC's Entra SAML at
# uscauth.aimsparking.com. Reviewed: 2 GET JSON ops, read-only. The pages carry
# Order Permit, cart and Pay Now; the ops never load them. /tickets/ sits
# behind a Cloudflare Turnstile and is not taught.
usc-parking signed-in-ok

# 2026-10-13: recsports.usc.edu's Current Facility Traffic page embeds a
# Connect2 widget whose data is this host's public JSON, keyed by USC's
# account key that the page itself serves. No cookie rides along.
usc-rec goboardapi.azurewebsites.net

# 2026-10-13: maps.usc.edu is a Concept3D map; its search box calls this host
# with the public map key the page serves. No cookie rides along.
usc-maps api.concept3d.com
